{# Buy page for the YAIkes extension.

   The purchase happens HERE and never in the extension. Paddle takes the
   payment, a webhook mints a licence key signed with an offline ECDSA key, and
   the buyer pastes that key into the popup. The extension makes no network
   request at any point, which is the product's central claim — a checkout
   inside the extension would falsify it and the privacy policy along with it.

   Identifiers come from src/_data/yaikes.json. Both are public by design: the
   client-side token is meant to appear in page source and a price ID is not a
   secret. The Paddle API key and webhook secret are neither, and live in Vault. #}

