<h1>YAIkes — unlimited icks</h1>

<p>The free edition keeps three filters of your own. This one keeps as many as
you like. Everything else — the four built-in icks, the review band, the
learning, the pattern discovery — is the same in both.</p>

<p><strong>{{ yaikes.price }}.</strong> Not a subscription. There is nothing to
cancel and nothing that expires.</p>

<h2>How it works</h2>

<ol>
  <li>You pay here. Paddle handles the payment and the VAT.</li>
  <li>A licence key arrives by email, issued to your address.</li>
  <li>You paste it into the YAIkes popup and press Apply.</li>
</ol>

<p>The key is checked <em>on your own machine</em>, against a public key built
into the extension. There is no licence server, no activation, and no account.
The extension makes no network request — not to check your licence, not for
anything. That is the same promise the
<a href="/yaikes-privacy/">privacy policy</a> makes about your feed, and buying
the paid edition does not change it.</p>

<p>Your email is embedded in the key and the popup displays it. That is
deliberate, and it is worth being straight about why: it is the only thing
discouraging anyone from posting a key in public. Nothing stops you installing
it on your own machines.</p>

{% if yaikes.paddleClientToken and yaikes.paddlePriceId %}
<p>
  <button type="button" id="yaikes-buy" class="home-btn home-btn-solid">
    Buy — {{ yaikes.price }}
  </button>
  <span id="yaikes-buy-error" role="status" hidden></span>
</p>

<script src="https://cdn.paddle.com/paddle/v2/paddle.js"></script>
<script>
  (function () {
    var button = document.getElementById('yaikes-buy');
    var error = document.getElementById('yaikes-buy-error');

    function fail(message) {
      // A dead button is the worst outcome here: the visitor decided to pay and
      // the page silently declined to take the money. Say so, and leave a route.
      button.disabled = true;
      error.hidden = false;
      error.textContent = message + ' Email kamilandrzejrybacki@gmail.com and I will sort it out.';
    }

    if (typeof Paddle === 'undefined') {
      fail('The payment window could not load — an extension or network filter may be blocking it.');
      return;
    }
    {% if yaikes.paddleEnvironment == 'sandbox' %}
    // Sandbox. Real cards are declined here; this must be removed before launch.
    Paddle.Environment.set('sandbox');
    {% endif %}
    Paddle.Initialize({ token: {{ yaikes.paddleClientToken | dump | safe }} });

    button.addEventListener('click', function () {
      try {
        Paddle.Checkout.open({ items: [{ priceId: {{ yaikes.paddlePriceId | dump | safe }}, quantity: 1 }] });
      } catch (e) {
        fail('The payment window would not open.');
      }
    });
  })();
</script>
{% else %}
